{
  "schema_version": 1,
  "locale": "zh-CN",
  "scenario_id": "5_02_048_22",
  "source_raw_hash": "sha256:009e99cdbdd569cf9f5bfff21a7390484159888db962e997963e4ffdb4c017e2",
  "entries": {
    "story-text:v1:5_02_048_22:5_02_048_22_a:cmd-000013:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:67a5893b2618fc7b274ad59270c589b5e5207309030601339d109792b3f71b5e",
      "text": "●●●●●●●●●●P酱，\n白色情人节快乐♪",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:5_02_048_22:5_02_048_22_a:cmd-000021:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:2ba873ef8b48eacbee4e6ebf5b8041a1a8bd29d0afc5fab310b2092815d84264",
      "text": "我准备了巧克力的回礼送给你哦。\n愿意收下吗？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:5_02_048_22:5_02_048_22_a:cmd-000030:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:8e2acfbb03300c0bc5256d7ad627abbbb304e2f6ef35ce0c9663766cb3f4d2f9",
      "text": "呵呵，你能高兴太好啦。\n你若是露出笑容，我也会忍不住开心起来的。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:5_02_048_22:5_02_048_22_a:cmd-000037:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:aeba6ede63b2124b7b8b8efe0b2c656e110304a32a443be7908c67f28ef21145",
      "text": "呐，等工作告一段落了，稍微休息一下吧。\n我来准备饮品和点心哦。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:5_02_048_22:5_02_048_22_a:cmd-000042:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:9489edbf40a08ce5c08e4006f47c7d277f8031282feda05ffc84507cc7b43119",
      "text": "毕竟是白色情人节嘛，\n我想看好多好多P酱的笑容呢。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:5_02_048_22:5_02_048_22_b:cmd-000016:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:91596b7f236b27f2a0e5bafbd621a86ddb1c745aeff68aacc64b1530ab5494bb",
      "text": "●●●●●●●●●●P酱，\n谢谢你特意过来。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:5_02_048_22:5_02_048_22_b:cmd-000025:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:19635c7a968429ae0f7004189faf3b02c0d0f97e789cdf771af172676e474da0",
      "text": "特地叫你出来真抱歉呢。不过，\n在这里的话就能和你慢慢聊天了嘛……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:5_02_048_22:5_02_048_22_b:cmd-000034:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:f0d4b196c3011e9b7dd6dbece830ffc49c7955b4a2252e9c4ebbdaa404a1a2cb",
      "text": "给，这个。是我送的情人节回礼。\n……愿意收下吗？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:5_02_048_22:5_02_048_22_b:cmd-000036:choice_short:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:9c3e0eab7135bbf0124c363d162784a0708abfe045d94917138ffb36a58b21a3",
      "text": "那是当然的！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:5_02_048_22:5_02_048_22_b:cmd-000044:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:96dba25781037d9abfee7da27e508d794bef66e338fd92d7734f84981d8f6d9c",
      "text": "……太好了。\n另外呢，我还有一个小小的愿望。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:5_02_048_22:5_02_048_22_b:cmd-000049:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:aac123a44f4f4fc3db5caf75bedd8200482831aacaab29120b248d9ae7579fe2",
      "text": "虽然现在说还有点早……\n明年若是能再给我巧克力的话，我会很高兴的。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:5_02_048_22:5_02_048_22_b:cmd-000051:choice_short:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:b2369d4f3671b15a3b795ec7ffacf9176e6e90817b316706812713c46147edad",
      "text": "当然了，明年我也会送你的",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:5_02_048_22:5_02_048_22_b:cmd-000052:choice_short:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:5c57c525858d3acaf36eb744e5f5e82e3c1c6b173bd724894858e45729d49ac1",
      "text": "何止明年，以后我也一直会送给你的！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:5_02_048_22:5_02_048_22_b:cmd-000058:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:290d9cbaf6d7af4a1445a75a47c27f1300cc8ead8cf8de7d30e827262d47a0cc",
      "text": "嘿嘿，谢谢你。约好了哦。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:5_02_048_22:5_02_048_22_b:cmd-000062:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:87ba367c1db28c6b8a5c9c00b4e9d3ae4845f2383265aeb2a2cd2828583bf5c7",
      "text": "为了能一直做那个能让●●●●●●●●●●P酱\n想要送巧克力的偶像，",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:5_02_048_22:5_02_048_22_b:cmd-000069:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:b785b450dc0c2304ec3eed3cb16848d7f45d3201dc5aaa6fcc05c1526ee77895",
      "text": "我今后也会继续努力的。\n所以，明年，还有以后的日子也都请多关照哦。",
      "status": "draft"
    }
  }
}
